# --- Template .gitignore for KID -----------------------------------------
# Generated by inspecting the repo's actual contents. Review each section
# before committing -- some choices below are judgment calls (e.g. whether
# raw data belongs in this repo at all), not hard rules. Edit freely.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
.vscode/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Large / binary blobs at the repo root ---
# kid_figure.key (~108 MB) and the resonator_tools zip are large binaries that
# don't diff meaningfully in git. If you want resonator_tools-master/ tracked
# as code, keep the directory but drop the zip; if kid_figure.key needs
# versioning, consider Git LFS instead of plain git.
*.key
resonator_tools-master.zip
AzureSample/
test_2026Feb/
NI_manual/
test_2026Apr/
old/



# --- Raw waveform/measurement data ---
# data/ (and daqpc_copy/alldata/, its raw source) hold ~1155 .npz files plus
# their companion _ana.csv outputs -- raw instrument output and derived
# analysis products, not source code. analysis/<Month><Day>th/ are symlinks
# into data/, so ignoring data/ here is what actually keeps their contents
# out (the symlinks themselves are tiny and fine to track).
# If you DO want the data versioned, remove these lines -- but consider
# Git LFS or a separate data repo instead of plain git for this volume.
data/**/*.npz
daqpc_copy/

# --- Generated analysis output ---
# ana_forJPS.py / ana2nd_forJPS*.py regenerate these plots on every run
# (pc1.png, pc2.png, ..., pc1_tscan.png, pc4_fromcsv_alpha.png, etc.).
analysis/*.png
analysis/*.pdf

# --- Scratch / one-off test directories ---
# Uncomment if these are throwaway, not meant to be versioned:
# test_2026Feb/
# test_2026Apr/
